{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act9d0_level_act9d0_01_beg",
  "groupId": "act9d0",
  "stageId": "act9d0_01",
  "title": "埋藏",
  "storyCode": "DM-1",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act9d0/level_act9d0_01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "fd7f6e545ed396c239e1105c0f9842ead5b7821d8635c34a4e3071706ab48889",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "是我。\n已经抵达目标地点，肉眼确认到信号烟坐标。\n......很久没有和同行打交道，稍微有点损失。\n但是他们在地下发报站藏着的物资也很充裕，好歹能挽回一些。\n嗯，是的，斥候可以先出发了。\n我会尽快。\n......对了，有个意料之外的损失。\nW死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "......说的那么惨不忍睹，结果还不是四肢健全地回来了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "还是说，你只不过是想用苦肉计邀功？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "那么你也大可不必离开营地来接应我们，你不需要这么担心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "我不担心任何人，别自作多情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "如果不是W殿后为我们创造机会，我们谁也逃不出来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "......什么时候的事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "两小时前，通讯被隔断的时候，小队遭到了埋伏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "W摧毁了废墟，然后我们逃了出来，他死战到了最后一刻。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "可惜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "......的确，如果他能活着回到营地，按人头来算，他会超过我成为这里最值钱的雇佣兵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "算了，事到如今说这些也没意义，至少他不用再打仗了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "敌人已经撤退，要去回收吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "不可能，重新深入的风险太大，谁也承担不起。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "怎么？莫非你们关系很好？我怎么不知道？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "我只是可惜他身上的战利品。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "没什么特别的，有些人的藏品比他丰富得多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "等这场战争结束，我们有的是机会重操旧业。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "......如果会结束的话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "哼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "互相安慰的话之后再说。日落前我们要离开这里，再停留下去会成为众矢之的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "回营地去，立刻整队出发。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "哼——？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "你这是在命令我？赫德雷“副”队长？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "......其他小队都失去联系，现在总指挥权轮替在我手上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "我们平起平坐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "唉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "......伊内丝，我们赶紧离开这里，回到据点，然后联系雇主，重新商谈一下报酬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "这只是建议，不是命令，好吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "哼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "W的死，能给我们加上多少筹码？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "很多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "他是一名优秀的雇佣兵，明码标价的优秀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "那至少他......不算白白送死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "他最后有没有留下什么——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "——安静。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "有人靠近，三点钟方向，不是我们的人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "——只有一个人，滚出来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣衫褴褛的萨卡兹女性",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "萨卡兹......？本地人吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "不，不对，你手里拿着的是W的刀和铳......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "你是什么人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣衫褴褛的萨卡兹女性",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "不说话？那么，死吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "等等。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "她是跟着我们来的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣衫褴褛的萨卡兹女性",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "......你放任她跟踪你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "我们的行进速度不慢，她在取得了W的遗物之后徒步跟上了我们，以她的身手，徒步。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "她是个“有经验”的萨卡兹，我想在撤离的时候也许会需要一个本地向导。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "——你在发什么疯？那不是更应该在这里杀了她吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "你要是想害死我们所有人，大可直接动手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "我怎么敢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "那如果她是个刺客呢？如果她把我们带进布好的陷阱里呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "你知道卡兹戴尔有多少人想要你的脑袋吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "喔，有多少？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "......你面前就有一个。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "你的头非常值钱，只是暂且被我保存在你的脖子上而已，别太自以为是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "非常感谢你的勤俭，但是我也没有开玩笑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "她冒险捡起了W的刀，还有那把铳，然后正大光明地站在我们的面前。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "你的法术可以感觉到，她有敌意吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "......脑子正常的人都不会突然接受一个来路不明的萨卡兹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "嗯，这就是你我不一样的地方了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "一路上，我给过她很多次破绽，而她......向我扔了三次石子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "很有趣的示好方法，不是吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "......哈？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "按老规矩，也许我们应该给她一个机会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "这场战役造成了不少位置的空缺，比起用招募的手段招来一些同样来历不明的萨卡兹，我宁可，自己挑选。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣衫褴褛的萨卡兹女性",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "可她只是个外人，那套规矩也不该——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "——啊，算了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "十分钟后出发，我不在乎出发的是几个人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "text": "但如果我还要额外处理一具尸体——不管是谁的，都建议你动作快点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "呵呵，真是没耐心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "......好了，你，认真听我说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣衫褴褛的萨卡兹女性",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "你拿着的是我们战友的遗物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "放下这些东西，你可以活着离开这里，然后死在其他随便什么地方，但至少会死得迟一些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣衫褴褛的萨卡兹女性",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "最后一次机会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣衫褴褛的萨卡兹女性",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣衫褴褛的萨卡兹女性",
      "text": "嗯......机会？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣衫褴褛的萨卡兹女性",
      "text": "......我从来不觉得我有选择的余地，转过身的时候，你会出剑，我就会倒下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣衫褴褛的萨卡兹女性",
      "text": "从一开始......你的另一只手，就搭在剑柄上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "......很好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "你也许见过我们，或者曾经为别人干活，我不在乎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "但你知道接手战死者的武器有何意义，对吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣衫褴褛的萨卡兹女性",
      "text": "当然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "那么，优先准备撤退，详细的之后再说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "现在先归队——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "——“W”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "战争从未停止。我们的战争从未停止。\n就好像战争才是我们一直以来赖以生存的工具。\n......嗯，的确如此。\n有些人还在踌躇犹豫，有些人已经得心应手。后者生，前者死。\n而还有些人......天生就是这方面的好手。\n这倒是个意外之喜。\n在即将倒塌的废墟里见到她的第一眼开始，我就确信......\n她将会是最优秀的萨卡兹战士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
